      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MY MOON SHADOW (1) is a last start placegetter in a NG, jumping from this box and finishing a 6 length second over 300m at Taree Super Track. Boasts a strong record off this same box, including two wins and five placings from 11 starts. Rates a top chance. TOMMY TSUNAMI (2) turned spotting a big start finishing fourth (23.35) last time in a Mix 1/2/3 at this track. Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Has ability and is one of the better chances. PAPER SHREDDER (3) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish one length away in third (22.46) behind Tulsi Banner at Gosford. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and six minor placings to his credit. Expected to feature again. MARVELLOUS DUNN (5) can measure up with the right run.",
